<DocExamples Title="Data Demos">
    <p>This page show different approches on how incoming data can be visualized using ApexCharts.</p>

    <p>The Date time example below is very simple. It uses data where only one point is recorded per day.</p>
   <CodeSnippet Title="Basic DateTime" ClassName=@typeof(BasicDateTime).ToString()>
        <Snippet>
            <BasicDateTime />
        </Snippet>
    </CodeSnippet>

    <p>The aggregation example below assumes that there are multple sensor, for example temperatur sensors that measure the value for different rooms. The line chart should just show the average of all this sensors.</p>
    <CodeSnippet Title="Aggregate DateTime" ClassName=@typeof(AggregateDateTime).ToString()>
        <Snippet>
            <AggregateDateTime />
        </Snippet>
    </CodeSnippet>

</DocExamples>